0..70 Comment "// This source states a dependent case over the 2-sphere that its cell"
71..82 Comment "// refuses."
83..85 Comment "//"
86..163 Comment "// A case into a path family owes the transport of its answer along the cell."
164..239 Comment "// The refusal shows both sides of that obligation at a 2-cell, each by the"
240..258 Comment "// shared printer."
259..261 Comment "//"
262..339 Comment "// The family\'s left endpoint runs through `flatten`, which sends the cell to"
340..414 Comment "// reflexivity. So the answer at the point, carried along the cell, is the"
415..453 Comment "// cell\'s inverse and not that answer."
454..456 Comment "//"
457..490 Comment "// - see: #6458 — `flattenRefl`"
491..539 Comment "// - see: #6548 — the two notes of its refusal"
541..557 Comment "// The 2-sphere."
